        {
          "name": "Archetype",
          "type": "UObject*",
          "default": "nullptr"
        }
      ],
      "returnType": "Void",
      "docs": "Caches the archetype for this object during reinstantiation has we rename object in that phase.\nThis is only a utility method to ensure the archetype is not lost during reinstantiation\nas it renames and changes outers which makes impossible to retrieve it during the process.\n@param Object top cache its archetype\n@param Archetype to use as a cache, if null it will use GetArchetype on the owner of the specified object"
    },
